| onCrack | 1 | 1.05 | 1.04 | 0/2 | 1.07 |
| onCrack | 2 | 1.07 | 1.04 | 0/2 | 1.06 |
| onCrack | 3 | 1.06 | 1.10 | 0/2 | 1.06 |

